~ start
# Make Fenn face correct direction - "left" or "right"
# do CutsceneManager.player_face("")
Az: Heads up, kid. [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i] I just reached the [color="0B4F4A"]Den[/color]. It's [i]freezing[/i] in here.
Az: I'll- [wait=0.3][do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i] I'll see you when you get back. [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")]cough[/i]
Fenn: Yay! [wave freq=7 amp=20][color="B80006"]Big lady[/color] made it![/wave]
Az: [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i] Don't call me that. [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")]cough[/i]
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
Fenn worry: Are you okay?
Az: Yeah, I'm- [wait=0.3][do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")]cough[/i]
Fenn worry: Az?
Az annoy: I'm fi- [wait=0.3][do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i]
sound of Az falling to the ground
Fenn worry: Az, what's happening?
Az annoy: [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")]cough[/i]. I'm fine![wait=0.3] [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i] [font_size=60]I'm FINE![/font_size]
Az annoy: [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i]. Go on ahead. [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i]. I'll be fine.
Fenn worry: Okay...
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("8-Az-coughingFit-HeaterArea", true)
=> END